  "description": "Fuselage: Full-body cartoon wrap in bright Toontown colors: sky-blue upper fuselage with clouds, green landscape lower fuselage. Cheatlines: None. Tail: Multicolored (rainbow/pastel) Toontown artwork on the fin. Engines: approximate: light blue/white. Winglets: Chip 'n' Dale artwork. Titles: 'Toontown' lettering on the fuselage; 'Alaska' titles. Artwork: Mickey, Minnie, Donald, Goofy and friends on both sides; Chip 'n' Dale on doors and winglets. Painted at Spokane, ~400 hours over 20 days. Colors hex: approximate.",
