  "notes": "Drawn from both sides (right 2025-06-06, left 2024-08-08). The two sides differ: the green landscape reaches the crown at about x 0.36 on the right and 0.46 on the left; the right side has Pluto, Minnie and Mickey with Mickey's house on the fin, the left Daisy, Donald and Goofy with the Toontown towers on the fin. White cartoon clouds are scattered over the aqua (not drawn); the green carries darker bushes along its lower edge. The winglets' Chip 'n' Dale artwork wasn't visible in these photos. 'TOONTOWN' measured at x 0.48 (right) and 0.51 (left). Re-checked 2026-11-15 (drawn on the 737-800): the landscape's rounded front edge made smooth on both sides; titles' lengths kept (TOONTOWN measured, 'Alaska' 0.155-0.385 agrees with the right-side photo within about 0.3 m); 'Alaska' lowercase about 0.55 of its A.",
